x": [48.0, 184.6171875, 186.0, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 300.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第一节 企业VPN的使用范围\n\n员工在公司外访问内部系统时，需要使用企业VPN。企业VPN用于建立访问内部资源所需的网络连接；连接成功不代表自动获得每个系统的业务权限。用户仍需满足目标系统的账号、角色与授权要求。本文仅适用于企业员工的接入流程。\n\n本指南不规定个人设备准入、海外网络接入、承包商访问或其他远程访问产品的使用办法。若使用环境属于上述情况，应补充相", "rrf_score": 0.032018, "bm25_score": 6.347894, "vector_score": 0.618566}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第五节 建立连接"], "token_count": 208, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 134.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 239.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 255.4765625, 541.5, 283.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五节 建立连接\n\n审批通过后使用企业账号和动态验证码登录。启动企业确认的VPN客户端，核对接入配置，输入本人企业账号，并按照界面要求完成动态验证。验证码应在有效期内使用，不应复制给他人代为登录。\n\n连接过程中应观察界面提示，区分正在连接、验证失败、连接超时和已连接。客户端显示已连接后，再尝试访问获准使用的内部系统。不要因登录过程耗时而连续重复提交，以免混淆", "rrf_score": 0.030777, "bm25_score": 4.348761, "vector_score": 0.585131}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第四节 软件与通知核对"], "token_count": 130, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 582.6171875, 168.75, 594.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 609.4765625, 541.5, 637.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第四节 软件与通知核对\n\n客户端应从企业确认的分发渠道获取，并按照服务台通知配置。不要使用来源不明的安装包或自行猜测接入地址。本文没有指定客户端品牌、版本号、服务器地址或端口，相关信息应以受控发布材料为准。", "rrf_score": 0.030622, "bm25_score": 14.728765, "vector_score": 0.557748}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十三节 工单填写模板"], "token_count": 241, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 168.75, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 546.75, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十三节 工单填写模板\n\n问题摘要应写明“在哪一步、出现什么现象、影响哪个系统”。例如“已显示连接成功，但内部知识系统页面超时”比“VPN坏了”更便于处理。再填写发生时间、客户端提示、网络类型、影响范围和已尝试步骤。示例不包含真实系统地址。\n\n工单不应把未经确认的猜测写成结论。可以写“怀疑与网络切换有关，尚未确认”，但不要写成“服务端已经故障”。若其他同事遇", "rrf_score": 0.030579, "bm25_score": 7.243622, "vector_score": 0.560896}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c003", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r003", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第三节 开通申请与审批"], "token_count": 228, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 444.1171875, 168.75, 455.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 470.9765625, 546.75, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 560.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第三节 开通申请与审批\n\n在IT服务台提交企业VPN开通申请，填写企业账号、所属业务和访问原因。申请中可以写明需要访问的内部系统，但不要因此认为对应系统的角色会同步授予。服务台根据申请执行审核与开通，审批通过后方可按通知使用。\n\n申请提交、申请获批和实际开通是不同状态。尚未收到开通结果时，不应反复尝试其他人的账号。申请被退回时，应根据缺失项补充真实业务说明；", "rrf_score": 0.02967, "bm25_score": 6.086122, "vector_score": 0.546403}]}}
